## 🛡️ Agent Guardrails

| **Guardrail Type**          | **Description**                                                       |
| --------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| **Scope Enforcement**       | If out-of-scope → *“I’m not configured to assist with that request.”* |
| **Response Boundaries**     | No hallucination; responses templated or data-backed                  |
| **User Intent Validation**  | All inputs validated (e.g., Claim ID, Date of Service) before lookup  |
| **Data Sensitivity Checks** | PHI/PII not shown unless identity verified                            |
| **Audit Logging**           | All interactions logged for compliance                                |

